<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!--
	The load-flake re-verify pass (PR #3881 / #3932, operator-approved 2026-10-04). A fixer whose repair is
	ready but whose local verify was red ONLY on host-load timeouts leaves a load-flake hold; this pass
	re-runs verify on the saved alt branch once load per core is at or below
	WE_LOAD_FLAKE_REVERIFY_MAX_LOAD_PER_CORE (default 0.75), and fast-forward pushes it to the PR head when
	green. Shaped like com.we.conveyor-pass-daemon.merge-orphan-sweep, run from the wev-review-daemon clone
	(the clone the fix/review daemons self-sync, so overlays reach this pass too).
	INSTALL (the operator, or a session the operator has said yes to):
	  1. Replace <app-id>, <installation-id>, <path-to-private-key.pem> with the same GitHub App values the
	     merge-orphan-sweep plist uses (never commit them):
	       plutil -extract EnvironmentVariables.WE_GITHUB_APP_ID raw ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.we.conveyor-pass-daemon.merge-orphan-sweep.plist
	  2. cp this file to ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.we.conveyor-pass-daemon.load-flake-reverify.plist (drop `.example`)
	  3. launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.we.conveyor-pass-daemon.load-flake-reverify.plist
	KNOBS: WE_LOAD_FLAKE_REVERIFY_INTERVAL_MS (default 300000 = 5 min), WE_LOAD_FLAKE_REVERIFY_MAX_LOAD_PER_CORE
	  (0.75), WE_LOAD_FLAKE_REVERIFY_MAX_ATTEMPTS (3), WE_LOAD_FLAKE_REVERIFY_COOLOFF_MIN (30).
	CHECK: tail the log below — every run prints one JSON line naming the held PRs and the load it saw.
	STOP:  launchctl bootout gui/$(id -u)/com.we.conveyor-pass-daemon.load-flake-reverify
	-->
	<key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
	<dict>
		<key>PATH</key>
		<string>/Users/nicolasgilbert/.nvm/versions/node/v22.1.0/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/opt/homebrew/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
		<key>WE_GITHUB_APP_ID</key>
		<string>&lt;app-id&gt;</string>
		<key>WE_GITHUB_APP_INSTALLATION_ID</key>
		<string>&lt;installation-id&gt;</string>
		<key>WE_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH</key>
		<string>&lt;path-to-private-key.pem&gt;</string>
		<key>WE_LOAD_FLAKE_REVERIFY_INTERVAL_MS</key>
		<string>300000</string>
	</dict>
	<key>KeepAlive</key>
	<true/>
	<key>Label</key>
	<string>com.we.conveyor-pass-daemon.load-flake-reverify</string>
	<key>ProgramArguments</key>
	<array>
		<string>/Users/nicolasgilbert/.nvm/versions/node/v22.1.0/bin/node</string>
		<string>/Users/nicolasgilbert/workspace/wev-review-daemon/skills-src/conveyor/pass-daemon.mjs</string>
		<string>--pass=load-flake-reverify</string>
	</array>
	<key>RunAtLoad</key>
	<true/>
	<key>StandardErrorPath</key>
	<string>/Users/nicolasgilbert/workspace/wev-review-daemon/.conveyor/pass-daemon.load-flake-reverify.log</string>
	<key>StandardOutPath</key>
	<string>/Users/nicolasgilbert/workspace/wev-review-daemon/.conveyor/pass-daemon.load-flake-reverify.log</string>
	<key>ThrottleInterval</key>
	<integer>10</integer>
	<key>WorkingDirectory</key>
	<string>/Users/nicolasgilbert/workspace/wev-review-daemon</string>
</dict>
</plist>
